    '$[0]', json('{"title":"Confirm what the category covers","body":"Start at the Point Lookout Fishing Club (PLFC) clubhouse and identify the particular session. Ask the activity contact whether casual participation is available and what booking, fee, gear, supervision or check-in applies. Confirm places and the latest conditions before travelling.\n\nOpen the Point Lookout Fishing Club clubhouse | https://plfc-clubhouse.auraofintelligence.workers.dev/","captureNotes":"Capture the public join options with no application entered. Reference site: https://plfc-clubhouse.auraofintelligence.workers.dev/"}'),
    '$[4]', json('{"title":"Changes, check-out and next visit","body":"If your attendance changes, ask the organiser what substitutions or cancellation steps apply. At the end return borrowed gear, report a problem and check whether you can receive future updates or seek another category separately.\n\nCheck out with the activity lead and ask what to do next if you want another casual session, a different activity or an ongoing membership option.","captureNotes":"Walk through Event contact and public calendar with an approved fictional case. Show the starting status, the responsible person, the action and what you check afterwards. Reference https://plfc-clubhouse.auraofintelligence.workers.dev/"}')
